# Explicit build context: local credentials, databases and evidence never enter it.
**
!Dockerfile
!app/
app/**
!app/package.json
!app/pnpm-lock.yaml
!app/tsconfig.json
!app/build-plugin.mjs
!app/src/
app/src/**
